Hanuman reports grief-scorched Sita wishes to see victorious Rama with Lakshmana --- Rama plunges into thought tearful sighing and orders Vibhishana to fetch bathed adorned Sita --- Vibhishana bids Sita mount carriage and she wishes to come unbathed but obeys Rama word --- Bathed adorned Sita borne in curtained palanquin guarded and announced --- Joy dejection anger fill Rama hearing long-housed Sita come --- Rama orders Vibhishana to bring Vaidehi near and clear crowds with staves --- Monkeys bears rakshasas driven amid ocean-like roar --- Rama halts driving calling crowd his own and declaring conduct not veils clothes walls guards women --- Rama says no fault to see women in calamity battle svayamvara sacrifice marriage and bids Sita brought among friends --- Lakshmana Sugriva Hanuman dejected infer displeasure from harsh hints --- Veiled Sita approaches weeping Aryaputra and gazes with wonder joy love at Rama moon face dispelling grief